update_rule.pseudocode:
if t == mandate_start_day: set mandates per location types (work, school, retail, transit, outdoor)
Every update_policy_every_days: optionally adjust enforcement_level within [0, enforcement_level_max] based on recent compliance; cap fine_amount at fine_amount_max
Emit signals.policy_presence_by_location_type mapping type->bool; signals.enforcement_level, signals.fine_amount, signals.campaign_intensity=campaign_intensity; signals.policy_active = (t >= mandate_start_day)
